# Welcome — Layout A: hero banner

Full-width greeting strip (12x2) at canvas top. Time-aware greeting,
date, one-line org pulse. Sets tone, costs little height.

```
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                           |
|   Good morning, Kalle                  Thursday, jun 12   |
|   Normain . 14 members . 312 events this month            |
|                                                           |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
```

Config: none (schema is bare). Pulse line derived client-side from
live collections; degrades to greeting-only.
